sequenceDiagram
    participant B as ProcessBackend
    participant C as Child process group
    participant F as Output file
    B->>C: spawn and submit fixture
    C->>F: write output
    alt child completes before deadline
        B->>F: inspect bounded output
    else deadline fires
        B->>C: terminate and reap
        B->>F: inspect bounded output at arbitration boundary
    end
    alt oversized output observable
        B-->>B: classify output_limit
    else deadline without oversized output
        B-->>B: classify timeout
    end
    B->>F: cleanup artifact
